<%#
# «Удалить» of a row of a list

The last cell of a row of the generic lists (users, partners, banners, the accounts of a user): a button that asks «точно?»
with the name of the object and what happens to it (`shared/_confirm_action`), then deletes through the normal
`DELETE` of the resource. A user says in how many accounts the person is and warns when the person is the only
administrator of one; a row of «account user» only takes the person out of the account. Every delete leaves an entry in the
audit log (users by the model, the others by their controllers).

## Local variables:

- `resource`: the record of the row.
- `collection_presenter`: the presenter of the list (its `resource_name` says what a row is).
- `target`: what the address of the delete is built from (the record; a user as `User`, not as its subclass).
- `notes`: `SuperAdmin::UserRemovalNotes.for(users)` of the page (users only); optional.
%>
<%
  kind = collection_presenter.resource_name.to_s
  notes = local_assigns[:notes]
  texts = "super_admin.safety.destroy.#{kind}"
  common = { key: "delete-#{kind}-#{resource.id}", label: t('administrate.actions.destroy'), url: polymorphic_path([namespace, target]), http_method: :delete }
%>
<% if kind == 'account_user' %>
  <%# The person leaves the account; the person and the data stay %>
  <%= render 'super_admin/shared/confirm_action', **common, label: t('super_admin.clinic_card.users.remove'),
             title: t('super_admin.safety.remove_user.title', user: resource.user&.name, account: resource.account&.name),
             text: [t('super_admin.safety.remove_user.text', account: resource.account&.name), t('super_admin.safety.audited')],
             warning: (t('super_admin.safety.remove_user.last_administrator', account: resource.account&.name) if SuperAdmin::UserRemovalNotes.sole_administrator?(resource)),
             submit: t('super_admin.safety.remove_user.submit') %>
<% elsif kind == 'user' %>
  <% note = notes&.dig(resource.id) || SuperAdmin::UserRemovalNotes::EMPTY %>
  <%= render 'super_admin/shared/confirm_action', **common,
             title: t("#{texts}.title", name: resource.name),
             text: [t("#{texts}.text", count: note.accounts), t('super_admin.safety.audited')],
             warning: (t("#{texts}.sole_admin", count: note.sole_admin_in.size, accounts: note.sole_admin_in.map { |name| "«#{name}»" }.to_sentence) if note.sole_admin_in.any?),
             submit: t("#{texts}.submit") %>
<% else %>
  <% name = kind == 'platform_banner' ? truncate(resource.banner_message.to_s, length: 60) : (resource.try(:name).presence || collection_presenter.dashboard.display_resource(resource)) %>
  <%= render 'super_admin/shared/confirm_action', **common,
             title: t("#{texts}.title", name: name, default: t('super_admin.safety.destroy.generic.title', name: name)),
             text: [t("#{texts}.text", default: t('super_admin.safety.destroy.generic.text')), t('super_admin.safety.audited')],
             submit: t('super_admin.safety.destroy.generic.submit') %>
<% end %>
